# Expo data governance

Load `expo-security-and-data` and `expo-data-fetching` when data leaves the screen or is stored.

- Name the purpose, store, retention, and deletion path before persisting personal data.
- Keep personal data out of logs, analytics, crash reports, screenshots, fixtures, and git.
- Clear SecureStore secrets, session memory, and personal query caches on logout and account deletion.
- Do not whitelist auth state in an unencrypted persist config.
- Keep store privacy disclosures aligned with the data the app actually collects.
